{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project OBSCURE</strong> is a physics-based first-person puzzle game where you manipulate objects using the power of light.<br><br>Command objects using the power of &quot;Light&quot; and explore the forgotten chambers of an old facility. Harness the Law of Inertia\u2014the first law of motion\u2014and manipulate objects with the help of your flashlight. We aim to bring a fresh perspective to the puzzle genre, a mixture of both lively and realistic mechanics.  <br><br>As you progress, uncover secrets and prepare yourself for mind-boggling puzzles. Prepare yourself for an atmospheric steampunk experience. May the light guide you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf0 CUTTING EDGE TECHNOLOGIES FROM QUARK CORP!!!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> is a groundbreaking invention from <strong>QUARK CORP</strong>. It enlarges when exposed to light and shrinks back to its original size when the lights turn off. SIZE SOMETIMES MATTERS!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/858918efa54e79836ac8def70552b82d.poster.avif?t=1773330987\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/858918efa54e79836ac8def70552b82d.webm?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/858918efa54e79836ac8def70552b82d.mp4?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While our beloved <strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> changes its size, its weight also changes accordingly. But keep in mind \u2014 EXCESS OF ANYTHING IS BAD.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/807925f3035db468912accd71d0571ad.poster.avif?t=1773330987\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/807925f3035db468912accd71d0571ad.webm?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/807925f3035db468912accd71d0571ad.mp4?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> is now levitating \u2014 thanks to our cutting-edge technology, the &quot;<strong>F-0 FLUX</strong>&quot; NOT YOUR USUAL FLASHLIGHT.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/8c3b7b3742ae2af6e39b6d4bd9db4073.poster.avif?t=1773330987\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/8c3b7b3742ae2af6e39b6d4bd9db4073.webm?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/8c3b7b3742ae2af6e39b6d4bd9db4073.mp4?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But sometimes, it becomes just an ordinary flashlight, helping you open gates. Here at <strong>QUARK CORP</strong>, everything is high-tech \u2014 SO YOU WON'T NEED TO SEARCH FOR THE KEYS.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/f2b34bd58f5c67080dff44249def2cc6.poster.avif?t=1773330987\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/f2b34bd58f5c67080dff44249def2cc6.webm?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/f2b34bd58f5c67080dff44249def2cc6.mp4?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>L-3 PHOTON</strong></i> is just an ordinary sidekick of <i><strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong></i> . It absorbs light and emits it. WHAT A COPYCAT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/6e08b9f68fc888caf83adfcee184fdc4.poster.avif?t=1773330987\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/6e08b9f68fc888caf83adfcee184fdc4.webm?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/6e08b9f68fc888caf83adfcee184fdc4.mp4?t=1773330987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692740?t=1773330987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692740?t=1773330987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/dc53a0905a0efac1dc95eac14324bcb73b1ad14c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773330987","capsule_imagev5":"https://share